142 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 114 0 R/E(Many small caf\351s receive orders directly at the counter, by phone or through messaging applications. During busy hours customers may need to wait in a queue before they can order. Staff also need to manually write down or remember orders, which can sometimes cause mistakes, incorrect items or delays.)/Pg 11 0 R/K[1]>>
endobj

143 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 114 0 R/E(Customers may also have difficulty checking the full menu, prices and available products before they arrive at the caf\351.)/Pg 11 0 R/K[2]>>
endobj

144 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 114 0 R/E(Our project is an online order system for a small caf\351. Customers will be able to open the website, view the menu, select products, add them to a cart and send an order before arriving at the caf\351. The caf\351 staff will receive the order through an administration panel and update its status.)/Pg 11 0 R/K[3]>>
endobj

145 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 114 0 R/E(The system can reduce waiting time, make ordering easier and help staff manage orders in one place. It can also reduce communication errors because the customer selects products directly from the digital menu.)/Pg 11 0 R/K[4]>>
endobj

146 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 114 0 R/T(More and more, guests are beginning their journey online. 85% said they look at the menu digitally first)/E(More and more, guests are beginning their journey online. 85% said they look at the menu digitally first)/Pg 11 0 R/K[5]>>
endobj

