endobj

205 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 120 0 R/E(The three most important requirements are viewing the menu, adding products to the cart and placing an order. Viewing the menu is important because customers need to see available products and prices before making a decision. The cart allows customers to check selected products, quantities and total price before submitting the order. Placing an order is the main function of the system because without it the service cannot solve the problem of physical queues. These three requirements create the basic ordering process. Other features such as order history, advanced filters or interface customization can be added later because they are not required for the first working version.)/Pg 17 0 R/K[1]>>
endobj

